### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/health

### Public query by name
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/pois?name=三塔&pageSize=5
X-API-Key: demo-public-key

### Public query by bbox
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/pois?bbox=100,25,101,26&pageSize=20
X-API-Key: demo-public-key

